OL,3,AUS states call for big changes to
OL,4,AInstagram and Facebook as Meta child
OL,5,Aprivacy trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeta has been hit with successive
OL,8,Flosses in court over how its platforms
OL,9,Fhave targeted and harmed young users,
OL,10,Fbut a jury trial set to begin on
OL,11,FTuesday may pose the biggest threat yet
OL,12,Fto its operations.
OL,14,FThe trial stems from a lawsuit filed in
OL,15,F2023 by 29 US states, including
OL,16,FCalifornia and New York, in which they
OL,17,Fclaim numerous violations of federal
OL,18,Fand state privacy laws for children.
OL,23,APub: 16-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,118,105,200,160,0,100
