OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUS states call for big changes to
OL,4,AInstagram and Facebook as Meta child
OL,5,Aprivacy trial begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FNot only are the states seeking
OL,8,Fbillions of dollars from Meta, they are
OL,9,Fdemanding it make changes to Instagram
OL,10,Fand Facebook, including ending "like"
OL,11,Fcounts and infinite scroll.
OL,13,FShould Meta ultimately lose a case of
OL,14,Fthis scale, it could force fundamental
OL,15,Fchanges to the way young people
OL,16,Fexperience social media.
